WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
Welcome to our training on create a new product in Amazon's catalog one at a time.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.920
You'll need to list your products in Seller Central to sell them in the Amazon store.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:16.160
In this video, we'll review step-by-step instructions for listing products one at a time

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.869
that aren't currently in Amazon's catalog.

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:22.480
To begin adding products, click the menu icon

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.040
in the top left-hand corner, hover over Catalog, then click Add Products.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.910
You'll be redirected to the list your products page.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.360
On this page, you'll be provided with

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.600
six different options to list a product.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.800
In this training, we'll cover the three options you can

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.089
choose from to add a new listing, product image, web URL, and blank form.

00:00:44.089 --> 00:00:45.600
You can find additional

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:51.520
videos on the three remaining tabs in the More Information section in Seller University.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.280
Let's start with web URL.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.560
In the search bar, you'll enter the web URL to the product you want to

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.915
sell and click Submit.

00:00:59.915 --> 00:01:04.320
You'll be redirected to the complete your drafts page if Amazon detects that

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:10.053
there is no existing product in the catalog based on the web URL you submitted.

00:01:10.053 --> 00:01:11.200
Here, you'll find

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.440
the list of product drafts you have created using web URL, product image, and blank form options.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:22.816
It may take up to 15 minutes for your draft to be ready for your review.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.000
You can also refresh

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.604
the page using the Refresh button on the top right corner of the page.

00:01:28.604 --> 00:01:29.920
Once the product appears,

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.631
click on Review and Submit.

00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:34.711
You'll then be directed to the new listing form.

00:01:34.711 --> 00:01:36.080
First, you'll need to

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.560
fill out the required information in the Product Identity tab.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.800
Amazon will pre-fill information

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.364
based on the web URL you submitted with a yellow background.

00:01:46.364 --> 00:01:49.280
You can edit any of the pre-filled data.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:55.416
Once you fill out all the required fields in this tab, select Next.

00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:56.960
Once you select Next,

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:02.720
Amazon will notify you if you need any approvals to continue the listing process on this page.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:06.944
Click Apply to Sell and follow the next steps.

00:02:06.944 --> 00:02:09.280
Once you receive the required approvals,

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.392
you can continue the listing process.

00:02:11.392 --> 00:02:14.560
You can view the status of your selling application

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:20.400
by clicking the main menu in the left corner, hovering over Catalog and selecting View Selling

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:20.733
Applications.

00:02:20.733 --> 00:02:26.720
You can navigate through the tabs at the top of the page and fill in all the required

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:30.120
information highlighted with a red exclamation point.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.520
You can identify the missing or incorrect

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.707
information highlighted in red boxes.

00:02:35.707 --> 00:02:40.080
Once you've reviewed all the sections, you can click Submit

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:45.920
or select Save as Draft if you need additional time and would like to submit your listing at

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.219
a later time.

00:02:47.219 --> 00:02:49.816
To view your drafts, click Menu.

00:02:49.816 --> 00:02:53.280
Hover over Catalog, select Add Products and click

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.373
View My Drafts.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:57.653
You'll be routed to the Complete Your Drafts page.

00:02:57.653 --> 00:02:59.840
Click Saved by You to access

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:05.440
your saved drafts and select Review and Submit next to the product listing you want to complete.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.459
Let's navigate back to the List Your Products page.

00:03:09.459 --> 00:03:12.320
Product image is another option you can choose

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:16.231
to create a new listing with an image of your product.

00:03:16.231 --> 00:03:17.298
Select Upload Image.

00:03:17.298 --> 00:03:18.720
Find the image you

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:22.080
want to upload, select the image and click Submit.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.440
In the Generate Listing Content box, enter up to

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:29.890
100 words to describe your product and click Generate Content.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.560
The item name and product type

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:38.080
values will be automatically filled in based on the product description you've provided in the

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.600
Generate Listing Content box.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:44.160
You can either confirm or click Select Other to choose a different

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:44.922
product type.

00:03:44.922 --> 00:03:50.640
If you click Select Other, you'll use the Select a Product Type section to search

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.453
and select the product type that's most relevant to your product.

00:03:54.453 --> 00:03:56.880
You can type a category in the

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.400
search bar or scroll through a list of options.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.920
If you often add products from the same categories,

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.120
select the star icon next to those categories.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.920
These selections will appear under the Favorites

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.522
section for easy access in the future.

00:04:12.522 --> 00:04:16.240
After you find the category that best describes your product,

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.680
select it to continue.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:22.000
Depending on the category you choose, you might need to browse multiple

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.703
levels of categories and make a more specific selection.

00:04:25.703 --> 00:04:27.760
Selecting the right product type

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:33.040
is key to surfacing the relevant attributes you'll need to include in the listing form

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.073
when you start the listing process.

00:04:35.073 --> 00:04:38.800
And it ensures customers will find the right level of details

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.152
when they browse and purchase a product.

00:04:41.152 --> 00:04:43.840
After you've made your selections, click the Select

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.196
button.

00:04:44.196 --> 00:04:50.240
If a lock icon is shown next to a category, it means that the category requires approval

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.598
before you can create a product listing.

00:04:52.598 --> 00:04:56.640
Click the Learn More link next to the lock icon for more

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:56.988
information.

00:04:56.988 --> 00:05:02.560
After you select a category, you will be routed to the new listing form where you'll

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.548
create your listing.

00:05:03.548 --> 00:05:08.160
In the upcoming option, we'll walk you through the remaining fields to fill out

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.024
to complete your product detail page.

00:05:10.024 --> 00:05:13.440
The last option you can select from the list your products

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.860
page to create a new listing is blank form.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.520
Select this option and then click Start.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:25.760
Enter an item name that most closely aligns with your product and click Enter on your keyboard.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.267
This will suggest a product type.

00:05:28.267 --> 00:05:32.160
Click Select Other if you don't agree and follow the steps in

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.330
the previous option.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.280
If you agree, click Confirm.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.400
You can also choose to generate listing content

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.887
by clicking Try Now.

00:05:39.887 --> 00:05:44.720
Enter up to 100 words that describe your product and click Generate Content.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.973
You'll arrive at the Product Identity page.

00:05:47.973 --> 00:05:49.840
If your product has variations,

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:53.395
select the checkbox next to This Product Has Variations.

00:05:53.395 --> 00:05:56.160
Click on the type of variations your

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.010
product has.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:02.960
You'll need to add additional information about the Product Variations in the Variations tab

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.952
once you enter all the required fields in the Product Identity tab.

00:06:06.952 --> 00:06:09.280
When you fill in the Brand Name

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:14.400
field, if you're creating a new listing for a product that's part of a brand enrolled in Amazon

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:20.800
Brand Registry, make sure you enter the brand's name exactly as it appears on the trademark

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.667
submitted during the enrollment process.

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:26.400
It should have the same letters and special characters as

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.088
well as the same capitalization and spacing.

00:06:29.088 --> 00:06:32.160
This helps ensure that the product is successfully

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.984
associated with the brand in the Amazon Catalog.

00:06:34.984 --> 00:06:38.160
Note too that only three types of sellers can

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:43.360
use our standard listing processes to create product detail pages for products that are part

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:48.555
of an enrolled brand, the original rights owner who enrolled the brand, other sellers internal to

00:06:48.555 --> 00:06:48.880
the

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.362
brand, and resellers who have been associated with the brand.

00:06:52.362 --> 00:06:54.800
If your product is generic and doesn't

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:59.246
have a brand, select This Product Does Not Have a Brand Name.

00:06:59.246 --> 00:07:01.840
Next, enter your product ID or select

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.973
I Don't Have a Product ID.

00:07:03.973 --> 00:07:08.240
If your product does not have a product identifier, then select Next.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:14.400
If you used an image, Amazon will use Generative AI and pre-fill some product details,

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.457
which will be highlighted in yellow.

00:07:16.457 --> 00:07:19.200
You can select which pre-filled information you'd

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:24.080
like to be displayed for product description and bullet point fields by navigating through

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.000
the numbers found at the bottom of these fields.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.920
You can click Edit in the Generate Listing Content

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:36.960
section to add or modify your product information or manually make changes to the pre-filled fields.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.880
Once you've updated the details, click Generate Content to save your edits.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:47.440
If you selected blank form, you can click on Try Now in the Generate Listing Content box

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.960
and either enter up to 100 words that describe your product, upload an image of your product,

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:53.647
or both.

00:07:53.647 --> 00:07:58.800
Then click Generate Content and this will pre-fill some of the details in yellow.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:04.080
Again, you can select from a variety of options for the Product Description field

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.473
and Bullet Point field.

00:08:05.473 --> 00:08:10.000
You can click Edit in the Generate Listing Content section to add or

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:15.120
modify your product information or manually make changes to the pre-filled fields.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:20.080
The next section will walk you through the process that is common for both product image

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.640
and blank form options.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:26.320
If you selected variations for your product, click on the Variations tab.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:31.360
The fields that appear will depend on your Variation Attributes selection in the Product

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.172
Identity tab.

00:08:32.172 --> 00:08:36.640
For example, if you selected Color as your product's variation type,

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:40.480
you'll be prompted to indicate each color you'll list for the same product.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:41.925
Then click Add.

00:08:41.925 --> 00:08:45.760
You can repeat this step for each product you'd like to create within

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:47.840
the specific variation family.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:52.000
Update each child asin with your offer information.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:58.080
This includes the Contribution SKU, External Product ID, External Product ID Type,

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.760
Images, Offering Condition Type, Price and Quantity.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.880
Note that no two child asins can

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.587
have identical offer information.

00:09:06.587 --> 00:09:11.280
Required fields for each item are marked with a blue asterisk.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:16.160
The product information you fill out in the form's other sections will be copied across

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:22.080
each child asin, but you can make changes to each child listing individually after you create the

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:22.903
Variation family.

00:09:22.903 --> 00:09:27.840
Now click through the remaining tabs and complete all required sections with

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:28.845
your product's information.

00:09:28.845 --> 00:09:33.200
If you have a question about a product attribute while creating your new

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:37.050
listing, hover over the question mark icon for more information.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.360
A pop-up window will appear

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:44.720
with instructions on how to complete the field and give you the option to provide feedback.

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:50.880
Use the report an issue section to let Amazon know if a field or the options provided in a

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:54.123
drop-down menu aren't relevant to your product.

00:09:54.123 --> 00:09:56.960
If you don't provide all required information,

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:02.960
it could result in an unsuccessful listing creation, meaning you might receive quality alerts

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:06.903
or your products could become suppressed from customer's search results.

00:10:06.903 --> 00:10:08.480
You can also select

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:14.000
all attributes on the left-hand side to reveal additional tabs and fields, which are optional,

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.100
but allow you to provide more details about your product.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.960
You can also complete these fields

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.237
after you've created your listing.

00:10:21.237 --> 00:10:24.880
While creating a listing, follow Amazon's quality standards.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:31.600
Adding rich information like properly formatted titles, high resolution images on white backgrounds,

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:37.600
detailed product descriptions, and bullet points helps customers make informed purchase decisions.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:43.680
Adding precise optional information also helps increase your listing's discoverability.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:50.240
To review Amazon's suggested listing quality guidelines, search listing quality in Seller Central.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.720
Required fields for each item are marked with an asterisk and highlighted with red borders.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:01.975
After you've completed the form, check for one or more red exclamation marks.

00:11:01.975 --> 00:11:03.040
They'll guide you

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:07.316
to any fields you missed or errors you made while creating the listing.

00:11:07.316 --> 00:11:08.960
Then click the submit button

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.475
to create your listing.

00:11:10.475 --> 00:11:14.640
After it's submitted, the listing will be reflected in your inventory

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:15.693
within 24 hours.

00:11:15.693 --> 00:11:20.960
Alternatively, if you need more time and want to complete your listing at a later

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:26.791
time, you can click the save as draft button and Amazon will save your draft listing.

00:11:26.791 --> 00:11:27.520
You can

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:32.960
complete your listing at any point in the complete your drafts page and submit it once you're ready.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:39.040
This concludes our training on how to create a new product in Amazon's catalog one at a time.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:43.360
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store!
